About the job 
 Choosing Capgemini means choosing a company where you will be empowered to shape your career in the way you’d like, where you’ll be supported and inspired by a collaborative community of colleagues around the world, and where you’ll be able to reimagine what’s possible. Join us and help the world’s leading organizations unlock the value of technology and build a more sustainable, more inclusive world.
 Your role :
 •Design, develop, and maintain enterprise-grade dashboards, reports, and self-service analytics solutions using Looker and Tableau;
 •Lead the development of LookML semantic models, reusable data products, and governed metrics to ensure consistent reporting across the organization;
 •Define, document, and govern business KPIs, dimensions, measures, and reporting standards;
 •Collaborate with business stakeholders to translate reporting requirements into scalable analytics solutions;
 •Partner with Data Engineering and Architecture teams to define semantic models, reporting marts, and analytics consumption patterns;
 •Enable AI Agent Reporting, Natural Language BI, and Conversational Analytics capabilities through integration with Gemini and enterprise AI services;
 •Establish and enforce best practices for Looker development, performance optimization, testing, deployment, and analytics governance;
 •Implement security controls, user access models, and data governance standards within reporting platforms;
 •Optimize report and dashboard performance to ensure scalability and excellent user experience;
 •Support BI platform adoption through documentation, training, and knowledge-sharing activities;
 •Participate in release management, version control, and CI/CD processes for analytics assets.
 Your profile :
 •Proven hands-on experience developing solutions using Looker and Tableau;
 •Strong experience building and maintaining LookML models, explores, views, and derived tables;
 •Experience designing enterprise dashboards, scorecards, and analytical reporting solutions;
 •Strong understanding of dimensional modeling, semantic layers, and business intelligence architecture;
 •Experience defining and governing enterprise KPIs, metrics, dimensions, and reporting standards;
 •Strong SQL development and data analysis skills;
 •Experience working with cloud-based analytics and modern data platforms;
 •Ability to translate business requirements into scalable reporting and analytics solutions;
 •Strong stakeholder management and communication skills.
 What you’ll love about working here :
 •Flexible and dynamic work environment involving teams spread across different global locations;
 •Communities with shared interests and identities, all working together to advance diversity, equity and inclusion within the workplace and society;
 •Do you want to learn more? You will have access to various training programs and platforms (e.g.: content provided by Pluralsight, Harvard and Coursera);
 •Attractive benefits package (meal tickets, medical services, Benefit online, Employee Share Option Plan);
 •Capgemini Romania is an equal opportunity employer. We promote equality and dignity in all aspects of recruitment and employment, and all offers of employment and promotions are made based on performance, competence and ability.
 About Us :
 Capgemini is a global leader in partnering with companies to transform and manage their business by harnessing the power of technology. The Group is guided every day by its purpose of unleashing human energy through technology for an inclusive and sustainable future. It is a responsible and diverse organization of over 360,000 team members in more than 50 countries. With its strong 55-year heritage and deep industry expertise, Capgemini is trusted by its clients to address the entire breadth of their business needs, from strategy and design to operations, fuelled by the fast evolving and innovative world of cloud, data, Al, connectivity, software, digital engineering and platforms. The Group reported in 2022 global revenues of €22 billion. Apply now!
 Visit https://www.capgemini.com/ for more information.
